      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Foster_City%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Foster City is home to tech giants like Gilead Sciences, Zoox, and Replit, reflecting its Silicon Valley ties.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
